rtw89 of Linux 6.18.63 on Linux 6.12: the mac80211 interfaces that changed in between.

- config, set_rts_threshold, set_antenna, get_antenna: without the radio index (added in 6.17)
- link_sta_rc_update (6.13) is sta_rc_update in 6.12, for the station; its default link stands for it
- ieee80211_gtk_rekey_add takes the key as a key_conf in 6.12 (only used for wake on WLAN, which OOS does not use)

